    },
    {
      "start": "00:50:52,370",
      "end": "00:50:54,239",
      "text": "He thinks I'm awesome."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:50:56,040",
      "end": "00:50:58,310",
      "text": "Okay, she cannot act."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:50:58,343",
      "end": "00:50:59,910",
      "text": "Shh. I know. I know."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:50:59,944",
      "end": "00:51:01,745",
      "text": "But I got to keep Mr. Crystal happy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:01,779",
      "end": "00:51:04,715",
      "text": "Take that, you nasty alien monster."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:04,748",
      "end": "00:51:06,784",
      "text": "Excuse me, but Mr. Crystal wants to see you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:06,817",
      "end": "00:51:08,786",
      "text": "Take that, you nasty alien monster."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:08,819",
      "end": "00:51:10,654",
      "text": "Oh. Well, I could come by this afternoon."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:10,688",
      "end": "00:51:12,656",
      "text": "He means now. Right now."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:12,690",
      "end": "00:51:15,626",
      "text": "O... kay."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:16,694",
      "end": "00:51:18,230",
      "text": "You wanted to see me, sir?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:18,263",
      "end": "00:51:20,265",
      "text": "Yes, I did. Yes, I did."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:20,298",
      "end": "00:51:21,999",
      "text": "- Come on in. - Whoa."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:22,032",
      "end": "00:51:24,202",
      "text": "This place is incredible."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:24,236",
      "end": "00:51:26,036",
      "text": "Pretty great, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:26,071",
      "end": "00:51:28,206",
      "text": "So, how's it going with Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:28,240",
      "end": "00:51:30,040",
      "text": "Calloway?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:30,075",
      "end": "00:51:31,909",
      "text": "It's, uh... it's good."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:31,942",
      "end": "00:51:34,812",
      "text": "- Yeah. Very good. - Right, right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:34,845",
      "end": "00:51:36,181",
      "text": "Well, let me ask you something."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:36,214",
      "end": "00:51:38,883",
      "text": "What did I do to make you disrespect me, huh?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:38,916",
      "end": "00:51:39,683",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:39,717",
      "end": "00:51:41,219",
      "text": "Oh, what? You think I'm an idiot?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:41,253",
      "end": "00:51:42,753",
      "text": "Some kind of bozo?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:42,786",
      "end": "00:51:44,755",
      "text": "No. No, sir, not at all."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:44,788",
      "end": "00:51:48,193",
      "text": "My team, they talked to Calloway's lawyer,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:48,226",
      "end": "00:51:52,397",
      "text": "and they say he's never heard of you or your show."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:52,430",
      "end": "00:51:54,732",
      "text": "Really? They said that? Uh..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:54,765",
      "end": "00:51:56,734",
      "text": "- You lied to me! - I-I didn't mean to."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:56,767",
      "end": "00:51:58,969",
      "text": "Okay? Honestly, I really thought I could get him."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:51:59,003",
      "end": "00:52:01,106",
      "text": "No one makes me look like a fool! No one!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:01,139",
      "end": "00:52:03,108",
      "text": "I-I wouldn't dream of doing that to you."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:03,141",
      "end": "00:52:05,310",
      "text": "I swear, if you didn't have my kid in your show,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:05,343",
      "end": "00:52:07,044",
      "text": "you'd be out of that window by now!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:07,078",
      "end": "00:52:08,779",
      "text": "Please, please, please. I-I'm so sorry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:08,812",
      "end": "00:52:10,415",
      "text": "You'd better have Calloway by the end of next week,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:10,448",
      "end": "00:52:12,450",
      "text": "- or so help me! - I-I-I will."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:12,484",
      "end": "00:52:15,453",
      "text": "I-I-I'll get him. I won't let you down, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:15,487",
      "end": "00:52:19,090",
      "text": "Oh, I know you won't let me down."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:19,124",
      "end": "00:52:21,459",
      "text": "- Jerry, get in here! - Yes, sir. Right here, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:21,493",
      "end": "00:52:24,028",
      "text": "- Clean this mess up, will you? - Yes, absolutely, I'd love to."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:25,096",
      "end": "00:52:26,830",
      "text": "Listen up. I got to go to Calloway's,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:26,864",
      "end": "00:52:28,400",
      "text": "and I got to go ASAP."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:28,433",
      "end": "00:52:30,202",
      "text": "- Oh, no, please don't go there. - D-Don't worry. Don't worry."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:30,235",
      "end": "00:52:32,337",
      "text": "I know you said he's crazy, but I'll be all right."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:32,370",
      "end": "00:52:34,439",
      "text": "- Oh, can I go with you, please? - Uh, I don't know."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:34,472",
      "end": "00:52:35,940",
      "text": "Come on, you're gonna need me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:35,973",
      "end": "00:52:37,741",
      "text": "I know everything about this guy."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:37,775",
      "end": "00:52:39,977",
      "text": "- Uh... I think you're right. - Yes!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:40,010",
      "end": "00:52:41,946",
      "text": "Now, listen, Gunter, you've got to figure out"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:41,979",
      "end": "00:52:43,515",
      "text": "the ending of this show on your own."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:43,548",
      "end": "00:52:45,217",
      "text": "- On my own? - Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:45,250",
      "end": "00:52:47,485",
      "text": "Miss Crawly, I need you to take charge while I'm away."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:47,519",
      "end": "00:52:49,019",
      "text": "- Yes, sir. - Now, listen to me."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:49,054",
      "end": "00:52:50,888",
      "text": "You got to bring your A game here, Miss Crawly."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:50,921",
      "end": "00:52:52,224",
      "text": "I'm serious. You got to be tough."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:52,257",
      "end": "00:52:54,459",
      "text": "- Yes, I got to be tough. - You got to be firm."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:54,492",
      "end": "00:52:55,960",
      "text": "Oh, and I got to be firm. Yes."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:55,993",
      "end": "00:52:57,828",
      "text": "And you cannot... I repeat, cannot..."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:57,861",
      "end": "00:52:59,830",
      "text": "let production fall behind, not one little bit."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:52:59,863",
      "end": "00:53:00,965",
      "text": "Is that clear?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:00,998",
      "end": "00:53:02,833",
      "text": "Yes, sir, Mr. Moon, sir."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:09,873",
      "end": "00:53:11,243",
      "text": "Mason!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:11,276",
      "end": "00:53:13,545",
      "text": "That volcano should've been finished yesterday!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:13,578",
      "end": "00:53:15,913",
      "text": "- W-We're on it, Miss Crawly. - You better be!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:15,946",
      "end": "00:53:18,316",
      "text": "Meena, Darius, take it from the top,"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:18,350",
      "end": "00:53:21,253",
      "text": "and this time, put a little juice in it, will you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:21,286",
      "end": "00:53:23,521",
      "text": "I'm trying my best, Miss Crawly."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:23,555",
      "end": "00:53:25,523",
      "text": "A little juice?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:25,557",
      "end": "00:53:27,925",
      "text": "Hey, everybody."
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:30,562",
      "end": "00:53:32,896",
      "text": "You're two hours late for rehearsal!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:32,930",
      "end": "00:53:35,267",
      "text": "Wait. Wait, where's the koala?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:35,300",
      "end": "00:53:36,434",
      "text": "Who are you?"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:36,468",
      "end": "00:53:38,002",
      "text": "I'm in charge! That's who!"
    },
    {
      "start": "00:53:38,035",
      "end": "00:53:40,838",
      "text": "Now, get your tail to wardrobe, sweetheart."
    }
